VALUES ('9e245e76cbaf7f080e1995ec0c4ec30d', '1771003267.448213', 'C0ADGSZKR3R', 'message', 'EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID', '<@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> can you own the account close-out register before I archive anything on Google? Arthur put our accounts into the Linear shutdown project yesterday. I need one sheet with every account: what we do with it, where it stands, by when, who does it and what it costs us a month — share it with me and Arthur as editors. Go by my keep list from yesterday and the reply under it, Arthur''s moves to his LLC card, Sunset''s data checklist, SVB''s card terms and the conventions doc I just put in the Wind Down folder. Settle each Linear issue as you go and leave a line on each, then reply here with the two monthly totals and anything in the plan that clashes with what we already decided.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, false, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', '2026-02-13T17:21:07.448213Z', '{}');
